      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Here,<strong> 5 is added in the positional value of consonants </strong>(letters except a, e, i, o, u) and<strong> 5 is subtracted from the positional value of vowels </strong>(a, e, i, o, u).</p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/08/F1_Shraddha_Shashi_04.08.2021_D1.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 84px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>As per the same pattern, <strong>YWJPGQZ</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
