      "id": "4ad48dbaa365-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "Select the option that is related to the fifth letter-cluster in the same way as the second letter-cluster is related to the first letter-cluster and the fourth letter-cluster is related to the third letter-cluster. PAVE : FXDT :: AXLE : FNAE :: BREW : ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the option that is related to the fifth letter-cluster in the same way as the second letter-cluster is related to the first letter-cluster and the fourth letter-cluster is related to the third letter-cluster.</p>\n\n<p>PAVE : FXDT :: AXLE : FNAE :: BREW : ?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "XGVF",
          "html": "XGVF"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "XHTF",
          "html": "XHTF"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "XGUF",
          "html": "XGUF"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "XGTF",
          "html": "XGTF"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p><strong>The fourth alphabet of the second letter-cluster is 4 letters ahead of the first letter of the first letter-cluster.</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>The third alphabet&nbsp;of the second letter-cluster&nbsp;is 3&nbsp;letters ahead&nbsp;of the second&nbsp;letter&nbsp;of the first letter-cluster.</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>The second alphabet&nbsp;of the second letter-cluster&nbsp;is&nbsp;2 letters ahead&nbsp;of the&nbsp;third letter&nbsp;of the first letter-cluster.</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>The first alphabet&nbsp;of the second letter-cluster&nbsp;is 1&nbsp;letter ahead&nbsp;of the&nbsp;fourth letter&nbsp;of the first letter-cluster.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Now,</p>\n\n<p>For&nbsp;PAVE : FXDT<span style=\"\">,</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F1_SSC_Arbaz_18-7-23_Prashant_D43.png\" style=\"width: 136px; height: 147px;\" /></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>For&nbsp;<span style=\"\">AXLE : FNAE,</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F1_SSC_Arbaz_18-7-23__Prashant_D18.png\" style=\"width: 138px; height: 147px;\" /></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Similarly, for&nbsp;<span style=\"\">BREW:</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F1_SSC_Arbaz_18-7-23_Prashant__D19.png\" /></p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>So, BREW is related to&nbsp;XGUF.</p>\n\n<p>The obtained pattern is&nbsp;PAVE : FXDT :: AXLE : FNAE :: BREW : XGUF.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 3&quot;</strong>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F1_SSC_Arbaz_18-7-23_Prashant_D43.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F1_SSC_Arbaz_18-7-23__Prashant_D18.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/07/F1_SSC_Arbaz_18-7-23_Prashant__D19.png"
      ],
